{
  "slug": "lusha",
  "name": "Lusha",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Prospect, enrich, and build call-ready lead lists using Lusha's B2B intelligence platform — verified phone numbers, company signals, and lookalike targeting.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `enrich-contact` (Look up a person and get their verified phone numbers, email, and company context), `lookalike-prospect` (Find companies or contacts similar to a set of references, then enrich results with verified phone numbers), `outreach-research` (Build a portable outreach positioning brief (what you sell, to whom, how you differentiate) before drafting multi-touch B2B…), `outreach-sequence` (Draft personalized B2B outreach copy (email and optional LinkedIn) for a shortlisted audience using a positioning brief plus…), `prospect` (Build a targeted list of contacts or companies from Lusha and return verified phone numbers alongside emails), `signal-prospect` (Find companies or contacts triggered by a buying signal, then surface verified phone numbers for the right decision…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `lusha`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lusha@claude-plugins-official` from `lusha-oss/lusha-mcp-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
